  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 300eb (Premium)</p>\n<p><em>Techhair upgraded with a variety of programmable hairstyles and colors, including Lead’s signature Glo™ light emitting technology.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Techhair Cyberware Enhancement.</strong> As long as the user’s techhair is styled to emit light, they count as having three installations of Light Tattoo fashionware only for the purposes of gaining the usual +2 Wardrobe and Style bonus for having three installations of Light Tattoos. While the user’s Techhair is emitting light, they suffer a -2 penalty to Stealth Checks to avoid being seen. Changing the styling of Techhair to emit light or not requires no Check but takes an Action.</p>\n<p><em>NOTE: Credit to Disdraft from the From the Ashes LC for the basis of this item.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Enhances:</strong> Techhair<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Fashionware).</em></p>"
